{
  "id": "JOB.15",
  "number": "15",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 15",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then answered Eliphaz the Temanite, and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Should a wise man utter vain knowledge, and fill his belly with the east wind?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Should he reason with unprofitable talk? or with speeches wherewith he can do no good?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, thou castest off fear, and restrainest prayer before God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thy mouth uttereth thine iniquity, and thou choosest the tongue of the crafty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thine own mouth condemneth thee, and not I: yea, thine own lips testify against thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou the first man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "was born? or wast thou made before the hills?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hast thou heard the secret of God? and dost thou restrain wisdom to thyself?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What knowest thou, that we know not?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "what",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "understandest thou, which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not in us?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "With us",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "both the grayheaded and very aged men, much elder than thy father.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the consolations of God small with thee? is there any secret thing with thee?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why doth thine heart carry thee away? and what do thy eyes wink at,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That thou turnest thy spirit against God, and lettest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "such",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "words go out of thy mouth?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man, that he should be clean? and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "he which is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "born of a woman, that he should be righteous?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, he putteth no trust in his saints; yea, the heavens are not clean in his sight.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How much more abominable and filthy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man, which drinketh iniquity like water?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will shew thee, hear me; and that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have seen I will declare;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Which wise men have told from their fathers, and have not hid",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unto whom alone the earth was given, and no stranger passed among them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The wicked man travaileth with pain all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "days, and the number of years is hidden to the oppressor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A dreadful sound",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in his ears: in prosperity the destroyer shall come upon him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He believeth not that he shall return out of darkness, and he is waited for of the sword.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He wandereth abroad for bread,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "saying",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "? he knoweth that the day of darkness is ready at his hand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Trouble and anguish shall make him afraid; they shall prevail against him, as a king ready to the battle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he stretcheth out his hand against God, and strengtheneth himself against the Almighty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He runneth upon him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "on",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neck, upon the thick bosses of his bucklers:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because he covereth his face with his fatness, and maketh collops of fat on",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "flanks.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he dwelleth in desolate cities,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in houses which no man inhabiteth, which are ready to become heaps.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall not be rich, neither shall his substance continue, neither shall he prolong the perfection thereof upon the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall not depart out of darkness; the flame shall dry up his branches, and by the breath of his mouth shall he go away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let not him that is deceived trust in vanity: for vanity shall be his recompence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It shall be accomplished before his time, and his branch shall not be green.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall shake off his unripe grape as the vine, and shall cast off his flower as the olive.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the congregation of hypocrites",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.15.34",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.15.34"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "desolate, and fire shall consume the tabernacles of bribery.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They conceive mischief, and bring forth vanity, and their belly prepareth deceit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.15.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
